    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It is time to fight! Challenge yourself with this intense, fast-paced, and super-sweet tank arena shooter.</h2><br>Take the role of a super cute tank and face evil grey tanks, trying to stop you from progressing!<br><br>Defeat all enemy tanks while dodging their bouncing bullets. Level by level they will get faster, smarter and deadlier.<br><br>Conquer 100 arenas of bullet-hell mayhem!<br>Unlock more heroes with their own sweet perks and upgrade your tank.<br><br>Stock up on lives, bombs, and shields and become the strongest hero. <br><br>Are you ready to face this challenge?<br><br>Be ready for a colorful, bullet-hell twin-stick shooter like no other!",
